  * Initial release: the Fireline agent-safety system for 3.0.0 "Backfire".
  * shadowfetch-firebreak: bubblewrap-contained full-auto agent launcher with
    read-only system, workspace-only writes, optional network cut, credential
    scrubbing, pre-run checkpoint and journald audit.
  * shadowfetch-checkpoint: snapshot/diff/undo one ~/Workspaces workspace.
